Sentence:
25
Kindle the fire of love and burn away all things;
Then set thy foot into the land of the lovers

Text:
Wherefore must the veils of the satanic self be burned away in the fire of love, that the spirit may be cleansed and refined, and thus may apprehend the station of Him but for Whom the world would not have been created.25
Kindle the fire of love and burn away all things;
Then set thy foot into the land of the lovers.26
